      "created_at": "2025-03-14T08:48:56.086Z",
      "cooked": "<p>How to set up Push Notification (experimental state as of now) in ERP Next hosted in Frappe Cloud ?</p>\n<p>I have enabled it in the Push settings.</p>\n<p>What else do we need to do? How to test it? Anything else to be configured ?</p>\n<p>Will this work along with the normal ‘System Notification’ type in Notification Doctype ?</p>",
