      "id": 461128,
      "username": "nikkothari22",
      "name": "Nikhil Kothari",
      "created_at": "2025-03-14T13:13:18.495Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You just need to enable it in Push Notification settings and that’s it.</p>\n<p>Only certain apps use this capability (Raven and FrappeHR) - so if you go to Raven or the Frappe HR mobile app and enable push notifications, it should work.</p>\n<p>It won’t work for System Notifications - only for apps that use the push notification service.</p>",
