      "created_at": "2025-03-14T13:23:26.065Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thanks <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/nikkothari22\">@nikkothari22</a> !</p>\n<p>But, is there any way where in we can send notifications (browser notification) to the users, apart from the notification available within ERP Next ?</p>\n<p>Say, can we write a server script and initiate this push notification ?</p>",
